{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49678","headline":"贺明朝 二 · 欧阳炯","name":"贺明朝 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔花间相见後，只凭纤手，暗抛红豆。\n人前不解，巧传心事，别来依旧，孤负春昼。\n碧罗衣上蹙金绣，覩对对鸳鸯，空裛泪痕透。\n想韶颜非久，终是爲伊，只[恁]偷瘦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}